# VESPER HALL SECRET LAB -- hidden beneath the library
# Tileset: TILESET_FACILITY (Cinnabar Pokemon Mansion). 10x7, buffer 208/1300.
# Why: a deliberate tonal shift -- the gentleman astronomer's hidden lab looks
# like the Cinnabar Mansion's ruined laboratory (teal walls, machines, journals).
# Stair 1d (top-left) climbs back to the gallery library ladder.
# THE COLLECTOR waits on the ritual rug (03) before the Shadow Prism pedestal.
ref PokemonMansion
tileset facility
key W=01 m=02 ,=07 Y=1d P=08 d=0f c=10 t=16 T=17 b=19 B=2d s=52 l=0a L=0d k=06 h=03
grid:
YWmmWtTWkW
,,,,,,,,,,
,P,,dd,,c,
,,,,,,,,,,
,bB,hh,,s,
,,,,hh,,,,
l,,,,,,,,L
end
exit STAIRS 1 0
obj trainer 4 6 ScientistAde down 3
obj trainer 15 3 ScientistBo left 4
obj trainer 9 7 TheCollector down 2
obj item 9 10 ShadowPrism
obj sign 3 4 LabJournal
obj item 16 12 FullRestore
